(text "One I2C bus, pulled up to VDD.\nLSM6DSO address 0x6A: SDO/SA0 tied to GND, CS tied to VDD, SPI pins SDx/SCx open. INT1 is the data-ready line.\nMAX30102 digital supply is V1V8 (1.7 V to 2.0 V). LED anodes are VBAT. Stop PPG when the cell is under 3.2 V.\nMAX17048 rides on the cell. ALRT is open-drain and is pulled up to VDD, not to VBAT. QSTRT is left open (internal pull-up).\nOLED connector is GND, VDD, SCL, SDA, RES for an I2C SSD1306 panel. Confirm the panel pin order before layout.\nThe button is active-low. The coin motor returns through Q1; D2 is the flyback diode." (at 40 230 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
  (uuid 00420921-d204-4241-b50e-e3f6feae7639)
)

  (sheet_instances (path "/a1b2c3d4-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/d1b2c3d4-4444-4444-8444-444444444444" (page "4")))
